Comment: RFC and IETF draft documents are excluded from the source tarball due
 to their non-free license (IETF BCP 78 / RFC 5378 prohibits modification and
 derivative works). The prebuilt EFI binary is also excluded as it is only
 needed for testing on EFI systems and is not buildable from source in this
 package.

